{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，也愿意继续陪伴对方，于是决定不再隐藏喜欢、不再为这份感情道歉；虽然很高兴，但也隐约担心两人未必能一直亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、坦然、珍惜、隐忧、心口发疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"右侧七个阶段词基本需要逐条读；金色小字里的期待终于满足但还没结束，以及旧房子、从梦里落回现实的两个画面不容易一眼抓到。红色长句中即使对方不需要他仍愿意陪伴的态度，也容易被加亮的关键词盖过。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他决定不再藏着对对方的喜欢，也不再觉得自己这么在乎对方有什么不好，但想到未来未必还能一直陪伴对方，心里又有些发疼。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、坦然、珍惜、担忧、心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"主要信息与第一张相同。小号金色文字中的期待、旧房子和梦境画面需要逐句读；右侧阶段列表也难以一眼理解其完整变化过程。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他终于愿意坦然承认自己对对方的喜欢，也为这份在乎感到高兴，但又意识到两人未来未必总能亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、坦然、珍惜、隐忧、心口发疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的夕阳画面需要读完整句才能理解；旧房子和梦境两个比喻同样不容易扫到。金色辅助文字现在有多条连续出现，彼此都在描述感受和画面，但一眼不容易判断它们各自承担什么作用。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三块大字号正文都比较长，而且视觉分量接近。红色段落讲不再隐藏喜欢，金色段落讲欢喜，灰色段落讲亲近可能无法持续、欢喜因此变成心口发疼，三者实际有清楚的情绪因果，但需要扫过各段的完整句子才能真正串起来。尤其第三张又增加了一条夕阳画面，连同旧房子、梦境等比喻，小字信息逐渐变多，容易让画面和感受变成需要自己整理的多个片段。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8895486d-ae98-4917-a063-77a245e30c94", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223956475498Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:41:47.404724+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "08c82a15ffdd3e8ddbb59072ece9493ac63cdefd22e61925e56272ac4b42ffdb", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223956475498Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "706831ab1215a58cd46fed87af5d05767cb31d5b4d6abdab031d2baa79a2969f"}}}
